  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guidebook on Rules of Procedure for Environmental Cases: Strengthening Judicial Capacities in Southeast Asia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen judicial capacity in Southeast Asia to effectively adjudicate environmental disputes by advancing the development of a regional guidebook on rules of procedure for environmental cases. Building on work from Phase 1, Phase 2 will produce a comprehensive draft. This draft will serve as the basis for regional consultation and further refinement, ensuring it is accessible, context-sensitive, and practically useful for judiciaries.</narrative>
  </description>
